<doctag><section_header_level_1><loc_115><loc_54><loc_385><loc_68>Quarterly Financial Overview</section_header_level_1>
<text><loc_64><loc_80><loc_425><loc_93>This report summarizes regional revenue performance across the first two quarters of the fiscal year and documents the methodology used to compile it.</text>
<section_header_level_1><loc_64><loc_104><loc_177><loc_113>Regional Revenue</section_header_level_1>
<text><loc_64><loc_122><loc_328><loc_128>The table below lists quarterly revenue by region, in thousands of dollars.</text>
<otsl><loc_99><loc_132><loc_401><loc_209><ched>Region<ched>Q1 Revenue<ched>Q2 Revenue<nl><fcel>North<fcel>1200<fcel>1500<nl><fcel>South<fcel>900<fcel>1100<nl><fcel>East<fcel>700<fcel>850<nl><fcel>West<fcel>1300<fcel>1600<nl></otsl>
<section_header_level_1><loc_64><loc_229><loc_145><loc_238>Methodology</section_header_level_1>
<text><loc_64><loc_247><loc_394><loc_253>We aggregated figures from regional ledgers and reconciled them against bank statements.</text>
<section_header_level_1><loc_64><loc_260><loc_132><loc_267>Data Sources</section_header_level_1>
<text><loc_64><loc_275><loc_407><loc_280>Ledgers were exported monthly from the accounting system and validated by the finance team.</text>
